27:["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-gray-600","children":"A tonometry test measures the pressure inside your eyes, which is an important screening tool for glaucoma. This may involve a gentle puff of air or a small probe touching the surface of your eye (after numbing drops are applied)."}]
