2a:["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-8 prose prose-lg max-w-none text-gray-600 space-y-4","children":["$","p",null,{"children":["Many opticians in ","Tunbridge Wells"," also offer advanced tests that go beyond the standard examination. OCT scanning, for example, uses light waves to create detailed 3D images of the retina and optic nerve, detecting conditions like glaucoma and macular degeneration years before symptoms appear. Visual field testing maps your peripheral vision to identify blind spots. These tests are typically available as optional add-ons, and your optometrist can advise whether they would be beneficial based on your age, health, and risk factors."]}]}]
